$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Treatment of 4 with 1-2 mol % of TAPC in HFIP led to only small amounts
of 5 (7-13%) and its condensate (6) (3-7%) as well as cyclohexanone (7)
(1%) (entries 1 and 2). When the amount of TAPC was increased to 5 mol %,
4 was rearranged to 5 (40%) and 6 (26%) in 4 h (entry 4).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Beckmann Rearrangement, alternative preparation shownoptimization study
(stage 1- optimized on the catalyst, solvent and catalyst loading)
