$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM The first total synthesis of the proposed structure of montiporyne E
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Collison, Christina G.; Chen, Jian; Walvoord, Ryan
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthesis (2006), (14), 2319-2322

