$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 17-Aza-D-homoandrost-2-en-16,17a-dione (4),
(3β,5α)-3-Hydroxy-17-aza-D-homoandrostan-16,17a-dione (6), and
(3β,5α)-3-Acetoxy-17-aza-D-homoandrostan-16,17a-dione (5). A mixture of 3
(1.1 g, 3.33 mol) in AcOH (30 mL) at 80°C under N2 was treated with H2SO4
solution (5 M, 7 mL), stored for 14 h, cooled to room temperature,
treated with ice water (200 mL), and filtered. The solid was rinsed with
H2O and dried. The products were separated by column chromatography over
silica gel with elution by hexane-EtOAc (15:1). A mixture of 2 (0.1 g,
0.33 mol) in AcOH (30 mL) and H2SO4 (7 mL, 5 M) was transformed at 80°C
under N2 into 4, analogously to 3. Yield: 0.08 g, 80%.
17-Aza-D-homoandrost-2-en-16,17a-dione (4). 4: Mp 150-152°C. IR spectrum
(KBr, ν, cm-1): 1720 and 1690 (NH-C=O). 1H NMR spectrum (500 MHz, CDCl3,
δ, ppm, J/Hz): 0.78 (3H, s, CH3-19), 1.20 (3H, s, CH3-18), 2.83 (1H, dd,
J = 4.0, 18.0, Hb-15), 2.24 (1H, dd, J = 4.0, 18.0, Ha-15), 5.59 (2H,
dist.t, J = 6.8, H-2, 3), 7.85 (1H, s, NH). 13C NMR spectrum (δ, ppm):
11.87, 16.81, 20.06, 28.75, 30.64, 32.72, 35.93, 39.80, 40.27, 43.10,
52.83, 125.90 (C-2), 126.10 (C-3), 172.51 (NH-C=O), 179.90 (NH-C=O).
