$DATUM Methyl Ester of A-Homo-4-aza-3-oxo-18βH-olean-9(11), 12(13)-dien-30-oic
Acid (6). A solution of 5 (0.5 g, 1 mmol) in anhydrous dioxane (50 mL) at
10°C was treated with freshly distilled SOCl2 (1 mL), stirred for 10 min,
and poured into cold KOH solution (1%). The precipitate was filtered off,
washed with water, and dried. The dry solid was recrystallized from
MeOH:CHCl3. Yield 0.37 g (74%). Rf 0.54 (benzene + 1 drop MeOH), mp
264-266°C,[α]D20 +442° (c 0.04, CHCl3). IR spectrum (ν, cm-1): 3300-3100
(NH), 1726 (COOMe), 1664 (CONH), 1271, 1249, 1215, 1186, 1107, 1085,
1016, 997, 923, 894. UV spectrum (λmax, nm, MeOH): 285 (log ε 4.14). PMR
spectrum (CDCl3, δ, ppm): 0.83 (3H, s, CH3-28), 0.97, 1.00 (6H, both s,
CH3-26, CH3-27), 1.10, 1.12 (6H, both s, CH3-25, CH3-23), 1.24 (3H, s,
CH3-29), 1.34 (3H, s, CH3-24), 1.40-2.10 (CH, m, CH2), 3.68 (3H, s,
OCH3), 5.58, 5.62, 5.65 (3H, NH, H-11, H-12). 13C NMR (75.5 MHz, CDCl3 δ,
ppm): 1(40.6), 2(27.5), 3(175.3), 4(46.6), 5(56.3), 6(20.4), 7(30.4),
8(41.4), 9(154.5), 10(42.8), 11(118.9), 12(121.7), 13(146.3), 14(43),
15(25.8), 16(25.8), 17(31.7), 18(49.4), 19(38.6), 20(44.2), 21(31.2),
22(38.3), 23(27.3), 24(20.1), 25(20.4), 26(22.3), 27(22.6), 28(28.4),
29(28.5), 30(177.5), 31(51.6). C31H49O3N. MW 483.7.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
